{
  "$comment": "Boundary fixtures for PPh 21 / TER migration (Task 4). Every expectation encodes a verified primary-source fact from PP 58/2023 Lampiran, PMK 168/2023, UU 7/2021 HPP, or the PTKP PMK chronology. Rates are stored as decimal fractions (0.0034 = 0.34% = 0.34 percent). PPh amounts are 2-decimal currency strings in IDR. See data/v2/sources.json for primary locators.",
