    {
      "id": "nonresident-with-treaty",
      "description": "Nonresident with treaty: the illustrative treaty candidate (rule-pph-21-nonresident-treaty) is the only survivor because the default-20% condition does not hold. The treaty rate itself is illustrative, so we assert the winning rule id and that determination stays bersyarat (never tepat for verified_secondary), without pinning an authoritative rate.",
